message: "If you use this book, please cite it as below. Each released version has its own DOI on Zenodo."
type: book
title: "Flux, Pixels and Planet: End-to-End Workflows for Turning Remote Sensing Data into Insights"
authors:
  - family-names: Hendrawan
    given-names: Rifky Nauval
    email: rifky.nhsp@gmail.com
languages: [en, id]
url: "https://rifkynhsp-byte.github.io/Flux-Pixel-Planet/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rifkynhsp-byte/Flux-Pixel-Planet"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - Google Earth Engine
  - GeoAI
  - Indonesia
  - LiDAR
  - land cover
  - MRV
  - open educational resource
abstract: >-
  A free, bilingual (English and Bahasa Indonesia) book on Earth observation in
  the cloud: from the physics of sensing to Earth Engine, machine learning,
  LiDAR and GeoAI, with real outputs from Indonesian landscapes (flood, fire,
  peat, oil palm, paddy, mangrove, mining, solar, policy enforcement). Prose and
  figures CC BY 4.0; code MIT.
